{"t":"2026-05-28T03:42:12.476Z","event":"sdk_msg","msg":{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_01EybSwbjGKcAkGo49WLV54r","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01A5TXUBgEgxFp16hemBChjA","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/spy/mfautomations/repos/creation-station/reverse-search/synthetics/fixtures/jobs/pm-01-strong-senior.md","content":"---\n# Copyright 2026 VibeSpace LLC\n# Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0\n#\n# JD Fixture: Strong match for synthetic-mid-product\n# Contract: NUTRIENTS.md I.9 SyntheticJobFixture\n\ntarget_candidate: synthetic-mid-product\nexpected_hot: true\nexpected_score_band: high\nsource: lever\n---\n\n# Senior Product Manager - Collaboration Platform\n\n**Company:** Coda\n**Location:** Remote (US)\n**Salary:** $170,000 - $210,000 + equity\n\n## About Coda\n\nCoda is the all-in-one doc that brings words, data, and teams together. We're used by teams at companies like Uber, Square, and Spotify to replace dozens of disconnected tools with one powerful surface. Backed by top investors, we're on a mission to make a new kind of document.\n\n## The Role\n\nWe're looking for a Senior Product Manager to own our collaboration features. You'll define the roadmap for how teams work together in Coda - from real-time editing to comments, permissions, and integrations. This is a high-impact role where you'll shape how millions of users collaborate daily.\n\n## What You'll Do\n\n- Own product strategy for Coda's collaboration experience\n- Conduct user research to deeply understand team workflows\n- Define and prioritize the roadmap for collaboration features\n- Write clear specs and work closely with engineering and design\n- Drive product launches and measure success through data\n- Present product vision to leadership and stakeholders\n- Build relationships with customers through research and feedback loops\n\n## What We're Looking For\n\n- 5+ years of product management experience in B2B SaaS\n- Experience building collaboration or productivity tools\n- Strong analytical skills with proficiency in SQL and data tools\n- Excellent written and verbal communication\n- Track record of shipping products that users love\n- Experience working with engineering teams of 5-10 people\n- Passion for building tools that help teams work better\n\n## Bonus Points\n\n- Experience at other productivity or collaboration companies\n- Background in user research or design\n- Technical degree or coding experience\n- Experience with bottom-up SaaS distribution\n\n## Why Coda?\n\n- Meaningful equity in a growing company\n- Remote-first culture with quarterly team gatherings\n- Generous benefits including $5,000 home office stipend\n- Unlimited PTO and flexible work hours\n- Learning budget and conference attendance\n- Work on a product used by passionate users worldwide\n\nJoin us in building the future of team collaboration!\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3192,"cache_read_input_tokens":81818,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3192,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"115930cd-9f87-4632-b47e-ed08593aff21","uuid":"7070da7d-63f6-4f6d-857f-e3633178a2f9"}}
{"t":"2026-05-28T03:42:22.085Z","event":"sdk_msg","msg":{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_01EybSwbjGKcAkGo49WLV54r","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01RniwjFcTFy73AaHtM8zJ6m","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/spy/mfautomations/repos/creation-station/reverse-search/synthetics/fixtures/jobs/pm-02-strong-product.md","content":"---\n# Copyright 2026 VibeSpace LLC\n# Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0\n#\n# JD Fixture: Strong variant match for synthetic-mid-product (Developer tools focus)\n# Contract: NUTRIENTS.md I.9 SyntheticJobFixture\n\ntarget_candidate: synthetic-mid-product\nexpected_hot: true\nexpected_score_band: high\nsource: ashby\n---\n\n# Product Manager - Developer Experience\n\n**Company:** Linear\n**Location:** Remote (Worldwide)\n**Salary:** $160,000 - $200,000 + equity\n\n## About Linear\n\nLinear is the issue tracking tool that teams love to use. We're building the fastest, most beautiful project management tool for modern software teams. With 10,000+ companies using Linear daily, we're changing how teams build software.\n\n## The Opportunity\n\nWe're looking for a Product Manager to own our developer experience. You'll shape how developers interact with Linear through our API, CLI, integrations, and SDK. This is a unique role for someone who loves developer tools and can bridge the gap between technical capabilities and user needs.\n\n## What You'll Do\n\n- Define product strategy for Linear's developer platform\n- Research developer needs and translate them into features\n- Prioritize investments in API, integrations, and extensibility\n- Partner with engineering to ship high-quality experiences\n- Measure adoption and iterate based on data and feedback\n- Engage with the developer community through forums and events\n- Write documentation and guides that developers love\n\n## What We're Looking For\n\n- 4+ years of product management experience\n- Experience building developer tools or APIs\n- Strong technical intuition (coding experience is a plus)\n- Excellent analytical skills - comfortable with SQL and metrics\n- Outstanding written communication\n- Self-directed with ability to prioritize ruthlessly\n- Passion for craft and attention to detail\n\n## Our Culture\n\n- Fully remote team across the globe\n- Small team, big impact - every person shapes the product\n- Focus on quality over quantity\n- Transparent decision-making\n- Strong writing culture\n\n## Compensation & Benefits\n\n- Competitive salary based on local market\n- Significant equity stake\n- Premium health coverage in US\n- $500/month productivity stipend\n- Annual team gatherings\n- Latest equipment of your choice\n- Unlimited vacation policy\n\n## Our Stack\n\nFrontend: React, TypeScript, Tailwind\nBackend: Node.js, GraphQL, PostgreSQL\nMobile: React Native\n\nApply if you're excited about building tools that developers genuinely love!\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3192,"cache_read_input_tokens":81818,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3192,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"115930cd-9f87-4632-b47e-ed08593aff21","uuid":"cb56e7d0-de92-42db-987f-ba3965831fdf"}}
