vironments\n- Located in Austin or willing to relocate\n\n## Nice to Have\n\n- Previous internship at a tech company\n- Experience with SQL or basic data analysis\n- Background in design or engineering\n- Personal interest in fashion or e-commerce\n\n## What We Offer\n\n- Competitive salary for an entry-level role\n- Equity grant with growth potential\n- Health insurance coverage\n- Startup experience with direct founder mentorship\n- Austin office with snacks and weekly team lunches\n- Opportunity to grow into a senior role\n\n## Why This Isn't For Everyone\n\nThis is an entry-level position with limited resources. Senior PMs looking for established processes and large teams should look elsewhere. We're looking for someone scrappy who wants to learn.\n\nApply if you're excited about joining an early-stage startup and growing your PM skills from the ground up!\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3192,"cache_read_input_tokens":81818,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3192,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"115930cd-9f87-4632-b47e-ed08593aff21","uuid":"87f47889-251c-4bd7-a48e-8af332305f65"}}
{"t":"2026-05-28T03:42:40.406Z","event":"sdk_msg","msg":{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_01EybSwbjGKcAkGo49WLV54r","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01MD7ZxFoC9GCKVd874GQL4L","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/spy/mfautomations/repos/creation-station/reverse-search/synthetics/fixtures/jobs/pm-04-mismatch-eng.md","content":"---\n# Copyright 2026 VibeSpace LLC\n# Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0\n#\n# JD Fixture: Mismatch for synthetic-mid-product (Engineering role, wrong domain)\n# Contract: NUTRIENTS.md I.9 SyntheticJobFixture\n\ntarget_candidate: synthetic-mid-product\nexpected_hot: false\nexpected_score_band: low\nsource: lever\n---\n\n# Senior Backend Engineer\n\n**Company:** DataPipe Inc.\n**Location:** Remote (US)\n**Salary:** $180,000 - $220,000\n\n## About DataPipe\n\nDataPipe is building the next-generation data integration platform. We help companies move data between systems reliably and at scale. Our platform processes billions of events daily for customers like Shopify, DoorDash, and Instacart.\n\n## The Role\n\nWe're looking for a Senior Backend Engineer to join our Core Platform team. You'll build the systems that power our data pipelines, working on distributed systems, performance optimization, and reliability engineering.\n\n## What You'll Do\n\n- Design and implement highly available distributed systems\n- Build data processing pipelines that handle millions of events per second\n- Optimize system performance and reduce latency\n- Write clean, tested, and well-documented code\n- Participate in on-call rotation and incident response\n- Mentor junior engineers through code reviews and pairing\n- Contribute to technical architecture decisions\n\n## Requirements\n\n- 5+ years of backend engineering experience\n- Expert-level proficiency in Go, Java, or Python\n- Deep understanding of distributed systems concepts\n- Experience with message queues (Kafka, RabbitMQ, SQS)\n- Strong SQL skills and database design experience\n- Familiarity with cloud infrastructure (AWS, GCP)\n- Track record of building reliable, scalable systems\n\n## Nice to Have\n\n- Experience with stream processing (Flink, Spark Streaming)\n- Knowledge of data warehouse technologies\n- Previous work on data integration or ETL systems\n- Contributions to open-source projects\n\n## Our Stack\n\n- Languages: Go, Python\n- Infrastructure: Kubernetes, AWS, Terraform\n- Data: Kafka, PostgreSQL, ClickHouse, S3\n- Observability: Datadog, PagerDuty\n\n## Benefits\n\n- Competitive compensation + equity\n- Remote-first culture\n- Premium health benefits\n- Unlimited PTO\n- $3,000 home office budget\n- Annual learning stipend\n- Quarterly team events\n\nThis is a hands-on engineering role. Candidates seeking product management or non-technical positions should explore our other openings.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3192,"cache_read_input_tokens":81818,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3192,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"115930cd-9f87-4632-b47e-ed08593aff21","uuid":"60e539b0-91f0-49e7-92e7-bf7f308ef3dc"}}
