cess through data\n- Present product vision to leadership and stakeholders\n- Build relationships with customers through research and feedback loops\n\n## What We're Looking For\n\n- 5+ years of product management experience in B2B SaaS\n- Experience building collaboration or productivity tools\n- Strong analytical skills with proficiency in SQL and data tools\n- Excellent written and verbal communication\n- Track record of shipping products that users love\n- Experience working with engineering teams of 5-10 people\n- Passion for building tools that help teams work better\n\n## Bonus Points\n\n- Experience at other productivity or collaboration companies\n- Background in user research or design\n- Technical degree or coding experience\n- Experience with bottom-up SaaS distribution\n\n## Why Coda?\n\n- Meaningful equity in a growing company\n- Remote-first culture with quarterly team gatherings\n- Generous benefits including $5,000 home office stipend\n- Unlimited PTO and flexible work hours\n- Learning budget and conference attendance\n- Work on a product used by passionate users worldwide\n\nJoin us in building the future of team collaboration!\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null}}}
